---
import { Check, ArrowRight, ShieldCheck, Bot, FolderCode, LockKeyhole } from "lucide-react";
---
<section class="setup-utilities container" aria-labelledby="setup-utilities-title">
  <div class="setup-explanation">
    <h2 id="setup-utilities-title">We’ve packaged the agent setup for you, too.</h2>
    <p>Magpie includes the tools to set up and verify an isolated workspace, so you don’t have to assemble them yourself.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/docs/setup/secure-agent-setup" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See what the setup includes <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
  </div>
  <div class="setup-example">
    <div class="setup-request">“Set up an isolated workspace for my agent.”</div>
    <div class="setup-prepared setup-diagram" role="img" aria-label="Magpie configures an isolated workspace for your agent and project files, sets access rules, and verifies the setup using protections supported by your agent.">
      <img src="/wordmark.svg" alt="Magpie" width="142" height="40" />
      <div class="sandbox-boundary">
        <span class="sandbox-label"><ShieldCheck size={20} aria-hidden="true" />Isolated workspace</span>
        <div class="sandbox-contents">
          <div><Bot size={38} strokeWidth={1.4} aria-hidden="true" /><span>Your agent</span></div>
          <ArrowRight className="sandbox-connection" size={28} aria-hidden="true" />
          <div><FolderCode size={38} strokeWidth={1.4} aria-hidden="true" /><span>Project files</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sandbox-checks"><span><LockKeyhole size={20} aria-hidden="true" />Sets access rules</span><span><Check size={20} aria-hidden="true" />Verifies the setup</span></div>
      <p class="sandbox-support">Uses the protections supported by your agent.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="setup-approval"><ShieldCheck size={22} aria-hidden="true" /><span>You approve the proposed changes before installation.</span></p>
  </div>

</section>
